### Shared Post — Deleted Original (Placeholder)

When the original of a share post has been deleted, render `EtPost.SharedPost.Deleted` instead of the `<EtPost.SharedPost>` frame. Self-contained leaf — non-interactive, owns its own inset. Despite the shared `SharedPost.*` namespace, it is rendered directly under `<EtPost>` (NOT wrapped in `<EtPost.SharedPost>`); the dot is purely API grouping so the active-share frame and the deleted state are discoverable together.

```tsx
<EtPost {...outerProps}>
  <EtPost.Header />
  <EtPost.Body />
  <EtPost.SharedPost.Deleted text="The shared post was deleted" />
  <EtPost.Footer>
    <EtPost.Likes onPress={handleLike} isActive={isLiked}>{likes}</EtPost.Likes>
    <EtPost.Comments>{comments}</EtPost.Comments>
    <EtPost.Shares>{shares}</EtPost.Shares>
    <EtPost.Save onPress={handleSave} isActive={isSaved} />
  </EtPost.Footer>
</EtPost>
```

> **i18n note:** translation is the caller's responsibility — etoro-ui never imports `react-i18next`. Pass the already-localized string to the `text` prop.

