## Props

### EtPost Props

| Prop                 | Type         | Required | Default | Description               |
| -------------------- | ------------ | -------- | ------- | ------------------------- |
| `displayName`        | `string`     | Yes      | -       | User display name         |
| `avatar`             | `string`     | Yes      | -       | User avatar URL           |
| `text`               | `string`     | Yes      | -       | Post content              |
| `timestamp`          | `string`     | Yes      | -       | Time display (e.g., "2h") |
| `location`           | `string`     | No       | -       | User location             |
| `verified`           | `boolean`    | No       | `false` | Show verified badge       |
| `isEdited`           | `boolean`    | No       | `false` | Show "Edited" badge       |
| `maxLines`           | `number`     | No       | `4`     | Lines before "Show More"  |
| `onPress`            | `() => void` | No       | -       | Container press           |
| `onUserPress`        | `() => void` | No       | -       | User tap                  |
| `onMenuPress`        | `() => void` | No       | -       | Menu tap                  |
| `haptics`            | `boolean`    | No       | `true`  | Haptic feedback           |
| `children`           | `ReactNode`  | No       | -       | Custom children           |
| `style`              | `ViewStyle`  | No       | -       | Container style           |
| `testID`             | `string`     | No       | -       | Test identifier           |
| `accessibilityLabel` | `string`     | No       | -       | A11y label                |

> **Note:** Engagement data (likes, comments, shares, isLiked, isSaved) and engagement handlers (onLike, onComment, onShare, onSave) are **not** props of `EtPost`. They are passed directly to the footer subcomponents (`EtPost.Likes`, `.Comments`, `.Shares`, `.Save`).

### EtPost.Footer Props

| Prop       | Type        | Required | Default | Description                                      |
| ---------- | ----------- | -------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| `children` | `ReactNode` | Yes      | -       | Footer subcomponents (Likes, Comments, Shares, Save) |
| `testID`   | `string`    | No       | -       | Test identifier                                  |

