| Prop           | Type         | Required | Default | Description                                       |
| -------------- | ------------ | -------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
| `children`     | `number`     | Yes      | -       | Like count (rendered as formatted text)            |
| `onPress`      | `() => void` | No       | -       | Tap on icon (toggle like)                          |
| `onCountPress` | `() => void` | No       | -       | Tap on count (e.g., open likes drawer). Falls back to `onPress` if not provided. |
| `isActive`     | `boolean`    | No       | `false` | Whether the user has liked (fills icon + changes color) |
| `testID`       | `string`     | No       | -       | Test identifier                                   |

