| `onPress`      | `() => void` | No       | -       | Tap on icon                                        |
| `onCountPress` | `() => void` | No       | -       | Tap on count. Falls back to `onPress` if not provided. |
| `testID`       | `string`     | No       | -       | Test identifier                                   |

