## Subcomponents

### EtPost.Header

User avatar, name, location, timestamp, "Edited" badge, menu icon.

### EtPost.Body

Post text with inline "Show More"/"Show Less" expansion. Delegates all expand/collapse logic to `EtReadMoreText` (no expansion state in context).

### EtPost.Image

Full-width image attachment. Props: `source`, `onPress`, `style`, `testID`, `accessibilityLabel`, `accessibilityHint`.

### EtPost.Video

Video thumbnail with play icon overlay and metadata. Props: `thumbnailSource`, `title`, `host`, `description`, `onPress`, `style`, `testID`, `accessibilityLabel`, `accessibilityHint`.

### EtPost.Link

Link preview card with optional thumbnail. Uses a `card` + `cardInner` structure where the border is on `card` and overflow clipping is on `cardInner`. Props: `url`, `title`, `host`, `description`, `thumbnailSource`, `type` (`'link'` | `'video'`, default `'link'`), `onPress`, `style`, `testID`, `accessibilityLabel`, `accessibilityHint`. When `type="video"` a play icon is overlaid on the thumbnail.

### EtPost.Trade

> **Retired from the post feature (PE-1094).** The social post feature no longer renders the full-width trade card; it now uses `EtPost.Badge` (status pill) + `EtPost.Tag` (compact asset chip) instead. `EtPost.Trade` / `TradeRenderer` are kept exported for external consumers, but new post work should prefer `EtPost.Badge` + `EtPost.Tag`.

Trade card with market avatar, symbol, price & daily change. Props: `symbolName`, `displayName`, `avatarSource`, `avatarSvgSource`, `avatarBackgroundColor`, `avatarTextColor`, `rate`, `priceChange`, `priceChangePercent`, `direction`, `onPress`, `style`, `testID`, `accessibilityLabel`, `accessibilityHint`.

### EtPost.Poll

Interactive poll attachment with pre-vote (votable options) and post-vote (result bars, voter avatars, undo) states. Wraps `PollProvider` internally — consumers just pass props. Supports controlled mode (`selectedId`) and uncontrolled mode (internal state). Props: `answers`, `question`, `voteCount`, `onVote`, `onUndo`, `selectedId`, `avatarUrls`, `additionalVotersCount`, `style`, `testID`, `accessibilityLabel`, `accessibilityHint`.

### EtPost.Footer

Compound container for engagement actions. Uses `React.Children.forEach` to automatically lay out children into a left section (Likes, Comments, Shares) and a right section (Save, identified by `displayName`). All icons use `EtIconV2` with `md` size.

### EtPost.Likes

Like action — thumbs-up icon + formatted count. Supports separate `onPress` (toggle like) and `onCountPress` (e.g., open likes drawer). When `isActive`, icon fills and color changes to primary. Uses `useFooterActionStyle` for theming and `useHapticHandler` for haptic feedback.

### EtPost.Comments

Comment action — comment icon + formatted count. Supports separate `onPress` and `onCountPress`. No `isActive` state.

### EtPost.Shares

Share action — share icon + formatted count. Supports separate `onPress` (share action) and `onCountPress` (e.g., open shares drawer). No `isActive` state.

### EtPost.Save

Save action — bookmark icon only (no count). When `isActive`, icon fills and color changes to primary. Positioned on the right side of the footer automatically by the `Footer` container.

### EtPost.SharedPost.Deleted

Informational placeholder rendered in place of the embedded original-post preview when the shared post has been deleted (e.g. `share.isShareDeleted === true`). Self-contained leaf — non-interactive, owns its own horizontal inset and vertical margins so it aligns with the rest of the post chrome (mirrors the `<EtPost.SharedPost>` frame).

> **Namespace, not nesting:** `EtPost.SharedPost.Deleted` is a **leaf** rendered directly under `<EtPost>` — it is NOT a child of `<EtPost.SharedPost>`. The dot is purely API grouping so both states of a shared post (live frame + deleted tombstone) live under the same `SharedPost.*` namespace and surface together in autocomplete and Storybook navigation.

| Prop                 | Type        | Required | Default | Description                                                                                  |
| -------------------- | ----------- | -------- | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `text`               | `string`    | Yes      | -       | Localized placeholder message (e.g. `"The shared post was deleted"`). i18n is caller's job.  |
| `style`              | `ViewStyle` | No       | -       | Override the inner card style                                                                |
| `testID`             | `string`    | No       | -       | Test identifier on the card root                                                             |
| `accessibilityLabel` | `string`    | No       | `text`  | A11y label (falls back to the provided `text`)                                               |
| `accessibilityHint`  | `string`    | No       | -       | A11y hint                                                                                    |

> **Mutual exclusion:** render either `<EtPost.SharedPost>` (the live frame) or `<EtPost.SharedPost.Deleted />` (the tombstone) — never both in the same post.

### EtPost.SharedPost (Compound)

Nested shared post rendered below the outer post's body. Follows its own compound component pattern with three sub-components:

#### EtPost.SharedPost (Frame)

Outer container with horizontal padding. The left border is **not** applied here — it is rendered individually by `Header` and `Body` so that the attachment area renders without it.

| Prop                 | Type        | Required | Default | Description                       |
| -------------------- | ----------- | -------- | ------- | --------------------------------- |
| `children`           | `ReactNode` | Yes      | -       | Header, Body, Attachment children |
| `style`              | `ViewStyle` | No       | -       | Container style override          |
| `testID`             | `string`    | No       | -       | Test identifier                   |
| `accessibilityLabel` | `string`    | No       | -       | A11y label                        |
| `accessibilityHint`  | `string`    | No       | -       | A11y hint                         |

#### EtPost.SharedPost.Header

Compact header row: small square avatar + display name + dot separator + formatted timestamp. Applies a left border independently.

| Prop                 | Type         | Required | Default | Description                                    |
| -------------------- | ------------ | -------- | ------- | ---------------------------------------------- |
| `displayName`        | `string`     | Yes      | -       | Original author name                           |
| `avatar`             | `string`     | Yes      | -       | Original author avatar URL                     |
| `timestamp`          | `string`     | Yes      | -       | Time display (formatted via `formatTimestamp`) |
| `onUserPress`        | `() => void` | No       | -       | Tap on avatar / name                           |
| `style`              | `ViewStyle`  | No       | -       | Container style override                       |
| `testID`             | `string`     | No       | -       | Test identifier                                |
| `accessibilityLabel` | `string`     | No       | -       | Accessibility label for screen readers         |
| `accessibilityHint`  | `string`     | No       | -       | Additional hint for screen readers             |

#### EtPost.SharedPost.Body

Expandable text using `EtReadMoreText`. Applies a left border independently.

| Prop                 | Type        | Required | Default | Description                            |
| -------------------- | ----------- | -------- | ------- | -------------------------------------- |
| `text`               | `string`    | Yes      | -       | Original post text                     |
| `maxLines`           | `number`    | No       | `4`     | Lines before "Show More"               |
| `style`              | `ViewStyle` | No       | -       | Container style override               |
| `testID`             | `string`    | No       | -       | Test identifier                        |
| `accessibilityLabel` | `string`    | No       | -       | Accessibility label for screen readers |
| `accessibilityHint`  | `string`    | No       | -       | Additional hint for screen readers     |

#### EtPost.SharedPost.Attachment

Padded + rounded wrapper that clips attachment children (images, links, trades). Rendered **without** the left border.

> **Note:** `SharedPost.Attachment` - Attachment components inside a shared post **must** be wrapped in `SharedPost.Attachment` so that the border radius and padding are applied correctly within the shared post frame.

| Prop                 | Type        | Required | Default | Description                            |
| -------------------- | ----------- | -------- | ------- | -------------------------------------- |
| `children`           | `ReactNode` | Yes      | -       | Attachment component to wrap           |
| `style`              | `ViewStyle` | No       | -       | Container style override               |
| `testID`             | `string`    | No       | -       | Test identifier                        |
| `accessibilityLabel` | `string`    | No       | -       | Accessibility label for screen readers |
| `accessibilityHint`  | `string`    | No       | -       | Additional hint for screen readers     |

## Architecture

```text
post/
├── api/
│   ├── index.ts          # Public API exports
│   └── types.ts          # EtPostProps, FooterLikesProps, FooterCommentsProps, FooterSharesProps, FooterSaveProps, SharedPost* props
├── context/
│   ├── index.ts
│   ├── post-context.tsx  # PostContext, usePostContext (haptics only)
│   └── post-provider.tsx # Provider component (minimal — no engagement props)
├── hooks/
│   ├── index.ts
│   └── use-post-footer-logic.ts  # useFooterActionStyle() + useHapticHandler() utilities
├── subcomponents/
│   ├── index.ts
│   ├── post-header.tsx
│   ├── post-body.tsx             # Delegates to EtReadMoreText
│   ├── post-footer.tsx           # Compound container — React.Children layout (Save→right, rest→left)
│   ├── footer/                      # Compound footer subcomponents
│   │   ├── index.ts                 # Barrel exports
│   │   ├── footer-action.tsx        # Internal shared component (icon + count Pressables)
│   │   ├── footer-likes.tsx         # EtPost.Likes (thin wrapper → FooterAction)
│   │   ├── footer-comments.tsx      # EtPost.Comments (thin wrapper → FooterAction)
│   │   ├── footer-shares.tsx        # EtPost.Shares (thin wrapper → FooterAction)
│   │   └── footer-save.tsx          # EtPost.Save (standalone bookmark icon)
│   ├── shared-post/                       # Compound SharedPost + Deleted leaf
│   │   ├── index.ts                       # Composes Frame + Header + Body + Attachment + Deleted
│   │   ├── shared-post-frame.tsx          # EtPost.SharedPost (active-share frame)
│   │   ├── shared-post-header.tsx         # EtPost.SharedPost.Header
│   │   ├── shared-post-body.tsx           # EtPost.SharedPost.Body
│   │   ├── shared-post-attachment.tsx     # EtPost.SharedPost.Attachment
│   │   └── shared-post-deleted.tsx        # EtPost.SharedPost.Deleted (leaf tombstone)
│   ├── poll/                                  # Poll compound component (moved from et-poll/)
│   │   ├── api/                              # Poll types (PollAnswer, subcomponent props)
│   │   ├── context/                          # PollContext, PollProvider, usePollContext
│   │   ├── hooks/                            # usePollProviderState, usePollStats, usePollVoterData
│   │   ├── subcomponents/                    # EtPoll.* sub-components
│   │   ├── et-poll.tsx                       # EtPoll compound component
│   │   ├── et-poll.test.tsx                  # EtPoll standalone tests
│   │   └── index.ts                          # Public exports
│   └── attachments/
│       ├── index.ts                          # Exports individual renderers
│       ├── image-renderer.tsx         # EtPost.Image
│       ├── video-renderer.tsx         # EtPost.Video
│       ├── link-preview-renderer.tsx  # EtPost.Link (card + cardInner structure)
│       ├── trade-renderer.tsx         # EtPost.Trade
│       └── poll-renderer.tsx          # EtPost.Poll (adapter over PollProvider)
├── utils/
│   ├── index.ts
