### Behavior deltas (V1 → V2)

The strict-Figma migration to V2 introduced these user-visible changes:

1. **Container border-bottom** (NEW) — every post now renders a `1px` translucent grey divider (`carbonSecondaryDivider`, `#B2B2B226`) along its bottom edge per Figma. Feeds that already render their own row dividers will see two stacked dividers; consumers can suppress via `style`.
2. **Container background** — `bgNeutralPrimary` → `carbon050`. Light hex parity (`#FFFFFF`); dark hex shifts to `#1B1E21`.
3. **Header display name + footer counts** — `textPrimaryNeutral` → `carbon900`. Light hex parity (`#1B1E21`); dark hex shifts (`#E5E5E5` → `#FFFFFF`).
4. **Header location/timestamp + dot + menu icon** — `textSecondaryNeutral` → `carbon500` (`#999999` both modes).
5. **Active footer icon** — `actionBrandText` → `primary600`. Same brand family; slight hex shift consistent with et-button / et-link.
6. **Card borders dropped** (Link Preview, Trade) — strict-Figma decision. Cards now rely on the `cardDefault` translucent fill (`#1B1E210A`) for visual containment. Most visible in light mode where the card surface becomes a subtle grey wash instead of a hairline-bordered box.
7. **Card backgrounds** — `bgNeutralSecondary` solid → `cardDefault` translucent. Reads as a softer-on-page surface.
8. **Poll frame** — `bgGreyPrimary` solid → `cardDefault` translucent. Subtler.
9. **Votable poll options + unselected result fills** — `bgGreyTertiary` / `bgNeutralGreyQuaternary` → inline `${carbon900}14` (8% alpha). Slightly different contrast on both modes.
10. **Selected poll result + Undo button** — `indicesPrimary` / `indicatorPositive` → `verdictPositive600`. Same green family; slight hex shift (`#33C728` → `#0EB12E` light) — verdict-green is the canonical brand-positive in V2.
11. **Trade gain text** — `statusPositive` / `statusNegative` → `verdictPositive600` / `verdictNegative600`. Same as et-asset-item.
12. **Video overlay text + play arrow** — `textBright` / `textDark` → `carbonStatic050`. Consolidated to the always-white static token (both V1 hexes already collapsed to near-white).
13. **Shared post left border** — `dividerTertiary` solid grey → `carbonSecondaryDivider` translucent. Softer accent, matches et-asset-item / et-list-item divider treatment.
